//! omp-unified-exec's embedded brush shell, exported via N-API.
//!
//! The N-API subset of `crates/pi-natives` from
//! can1357/oh-my-pi@c2cb79e4c227aa4b22c4ccb933ff72fd88bceba4 that the plugin's
//! Brush engine needs: `shell.rs` (the `Shell` class, with a caller-provided
//! stdin pipe and `dispose` added), `shell/vfs.rs` (the filesystem callback
//! bridge, verbatim) and `task.rs` (without profiling and the crash handler).
//! Every difference from upstream is listed in `fork-features/README.md`.

